idgets_values_named":{"text":""},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":53,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-5741.083479744626,521.3108517072249],"size":[651.40625,856.609375],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 官方 ComfyUI Turbo workflow\n\n```\n8 steps\nCFG 1\nEuler\nsimple\n```\n\n## 按照 Krea 官方 μ=1.15 的 8-step timestep shift，原生节点大致是：\n\n```\n1.000\n0.957\n0.905\n0.840\n0.760\n0.655    ← Turbo step 5\n0.513\n0.311\n0\n```\n\n## RAW/Turbo 最理想切点：Turbo 原生 step 5\n\n也就是：\nσswitch ≈ 0.655\n扩展之后，因为前面 5 个 interval 每个被分成 6 段，所以 RAW 分支：\n```\nSplitSigmas\nstep = 30\n```\n取：\nhigh_sigmas\n大致就是：\n1.0 → ...很多 RAW 中间步... → 0.655\n而 Turbo 分支不要从扩展后的 sigmas 取得。\n直接从最初未经修改的：\nBasicScheduler Turbo 8-step\n接第二个：\n```\nSplitSigmas\nstep = 5\n```\n取：\nlow_sigmas\n于是 Turbo 拿到的仍然严格是：\n```\n0.655\n ↓\n0.513\n ↓\n0.311\n ↓\n0\n```\n只有 3 次 Turbo forward。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 官方 ComfyUI Turbo workflow\n\n```\n8 steps\nCFG 1\nEuler\nsimple\n```\n\n## 按照 Krea 官方 μ=1.15 的 8-step timestep shift，原生节点大致是：\n\n```\n1.000\n0.957\n0.905\n0.840\n0.760\n0.655    ← Turbo step 5\n0.513\n0.311\n0\n```\n\n## RAW/Turbo 最理想切点：Turbo 原生 step 5\n\n也就是：\nσswitch ≈ 0.655\n扩展之后，因为前面 5 个 interval 每个被分成 6 段，所以 RAW 分支：\n```\nSplitSigmas\nstep = 30\n```\n取：\nhigh_sigmas\n大致就是：\n1.0 → ...很多 RAW 中间步... → 0.655\n而 Turbo 分支不要从扩展后的 sigmas 取得。\n直接从最初未经修改的：\nBasicScheduler Turbo 8-step\n接第二个：\n```\nSplitSigmas\nstep = 5\n```\n取：\nlow_sigmas\n于是 Turbo 拿到的仍然严格是：\n```\n0.655\n ↓\n0.513\n ↓\n0.311\n ↓\n0\n```\n只有 3 次 Turbo forward。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":54,"type":"DisableNoise","pos":[-4236.565464805327,949.6522789608745],"size":[260.1875,33.9375],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"噪波","name":"NOISE","type":"NOISE","links":[79]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"DisableNoise"},"color":"#322","bgcolor":"#533"},{"id":57,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[-2921.543840235776,545.1950137743138],"size":[847.015625,1